WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Watch Faisal.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Narrator: He introduces himself, offers his arm, and describes the steps.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.800
Faisal: Three steps going down.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.700
Narrator: At the narrow gate, he moves his arm behind him.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.700
Faisal: Block 112, Row 8. Toilets are behind you, 20 metres.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.200
Faisal: Any marshal in yellow can help. I'm leaving you now - enjoy the match!

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:40.200
Narrator: At the seat, he tells Yousef where he is, where the toilets are, and how to find help.

8
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.000
Narrator: Then he says goodbye.

